# Side project room (issue 111d): the sofa seen from behind, its big flat back filling the picture with a pink highlight along the top, a dark band below, two low arms and short legs. A wrong view of `sofa-td` on purpose, bold flat shapes. 6x2 tiles.
size: 96x32
